  "body": "## Contribution\n\nThis package records a finite exact census and a scoped negative result for a four-register rational frame with exactly two independent address relations. It evaluates the proposed first-seven-prefix construction class; it does not establish an obstruction for arbitrary words or supply a new kappa.\n\nThe exact census enumerates all 120 rank-one idempotents in M4(F2), 105 off-diagonal patterns (including zero), and 196 realizable two-dimensional pattern planes. Of the planes, 176 admit a common topological order and 20 have cyclic union. The candidate screen checks all 20 exceptional planes under all six relation-signature bijections and finds no diagonal singleton endpoint. The exact 16-call positive control passes; a one-call deletion and an address corruption are rejected.\n\n## Pins\n\n- Base: `0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea`\n- Selected-result.json SHA-256: `10b9e340fd8e354a37a0c4813c90e5de1dd42044b5f6aca4a3fc5a42b685fa32`\n- Certificate SHA-256: `690de78db74c1ba59a4092b8f7b9f8f54c5d53d3650d9e8d78448cdddda18321`\n- Source hashes and repository blobs: `research/two-relation-pattern-census-seed52/SOURCES.json`\n- Direct predecessor: `research/bit-one-relation-seed04/`\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```sh\npython3 -I -B research/two-relation-pattern-census-seed52/verify.py\npython3 scripts/research_package.py --package research/two-relation-pattern-census-seed52 --check-only\npython3 -B scripts/research_baseline.py\n```\n\nExpected markers include `PASS_TWO_RELATION_PATTERN_CENSUS`, `PASS_PACKAGE_METADATA_AND_PINS`, and `PASS_RESEARCH_BASELINE_BINDINGS_ONLY`. The baseline confirms that the complex supplier still binds the selected conditional kappa; this scoped screen gives no kappa improvement.\n\nThe searched family, full stopping rule, proof-relevant certificate, negative controls, exact source pins, overlap evidence, attribution, and open follow-up questions are included in the package README and task metadata. Prepared with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; no independent human review is claimed.\n",
